  "_readme": [
    "DEMO DATA for Ghar Train. Station names, codes and approximate coordinates are real places; every TRAIN is invented.",
    "Edit this file to change the demo. The server reloads it on restart.",
    "Trains: 'route' lists station codes in order. Prefix a code with '~' if the train passes without stopping.",
    "'departures' are HH:MM times from the first station (one copy of the train per time). Copies get numbers base, base+2, base+4 ...",
    "'returnDepartures' create the same train in the opposite direction, numbered base+1, base+3 ...",
    "'speedKmph' sets running time between stations; distances come from coordinates. 'halt' is minutes at each stop; 'halts' overrides per station.",
    "'delayMinutes' is the simulated delay. 'noLive' lists copy indexes (0 = first departure) that have no live feed; 'staleLive' lists copies whose feed is 45 min old."
  ],
